<title>MALAYSIA: MALAYSIA STOCKS - Factors to watch - March 12.</title>
<headline>MALAYSIA STOCKS - Factors to watch - March 12.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are some of the main factors likely to affect Malaysian stocks on Monday:</p>
<p>* The Kuala Lumpur Composite Index closed 12.85 points higher to 1,250.33, led by bargain hunting and a drop in share deliveries.</p>
<p>* On Wall Street the Dow Jones Industrial Average closed 5.77 points higher to 7,085.16.</p>
<p>* DRB-Hicom shares remained mixed after being requoted on Monday. Analysts said they would continue to watch the shares closely.</p>
